  "description": "The logarithm function code takes the logarithm of the input to the defined base. The result is multiplied by a gain factor to provide the output. The logarithm function code is not limited to natural logarithms. The log of any value in base zero (natural) to ten can be taken. Use the logarithm function code in process control for performance calculations and monitoring.",
